description: Astro public app conventions
globs: apps/web/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# apps/web (Astro)

- Server-rendered public pages; minimize client JS (islands only when needed).
- Fetch data from `PUBLIC_API_URL` via `src/lib/api.ts`.
- Tenant pages live under `src/pages/host/[label]/`.
- Layout/branding: `src/layouts/Base.astro` + `src/styles/global.css`.
- Do not put claim/admin mutations here — link to the portal instead.
